@baseUrl = http://localhost:41210
@acceptedId = 11111111-1111-1111-1111-111111111111
@expiredId = 22222222-2222-2222-2222-222222222222

### Place an order with an invoice confirmation
POST {{baseUrl}}/orders
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "orderId": "{{acceptedId}}",
  "amount": 42.50,
  "confirmInvoice": true
}

### Inspect order and saga, initially Submitted, then Accepted
GET {{baseUrl}}/orders/{{acceptedId}}

### Request the invoice status from Billing
GET {{baseUrl}}/orders/{{acceptedId}}/invoice

### Trigger immediate retries, followed by a delayed redelivery
POST {{baseUrl}}/orders/{{acceptedId}}/process/transient

### Send a validation failure directly to the error queue
POST {{baseUrl}}/orders/{{acceptedId}}/process/validation

### Schedule a reminder, delivered after 10 seconds
POST {{baseUrl}}/orders/{{acceptedId}}/reminder

### Place an order without confirmation, which expires after 30 seconds
POST {{baseUrl}}/orders
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "orderId": "{{expiredId}}",
  "amount": 15.00,
  "confirmInvoice": false
}

### Inspect the expired saga after 30 seconds
GET {{baseUrl}}/orders/{{expiredId}}

### Request the expired order's invoice status
GET {{baseUrl}}/orders/{{expiredId}}/invoice
